# Scenario: a data platform lead weighs moving the on-premises warehouse to a managed cloud warehouse.
comparison "Move the data warehouse to a managed cloud service?"
mode: pros-cons
pro "Storage and compute scale independently"
pro "No hardware refresh in the 2027 budget"
pro "The vendor handles patching, backups and failover"
pro "Analysts can create sandboxes in minutes"
pro "Pay-per-query absorbs the month-end spike"
con "Egress fees on every dataset that leaves the platform"
con "Twelve years of ETL jobs need rewriting"
con "Monthly query costs are harder to forecast"
